# 统一换行，避免 Windows 上反复出现 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# Unity 的 YAML 资产 / 元数据：交给 Unity 自己维护，git 不要做行尾转换（否则易产生无意义 diff）
*.unity -text
*.prefab -text
*.asset -text
*.meta -text
*.mat -text
*.controller -text
*.anim -text

# 二进制资产：明确标记（同时也提示"不要 diff"）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.tga binary
*.fbx binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.wasm binary
*.br binary
*.gz binary
